        "calls": 1,
        "text": "When a Freebuff session ends in the terminal assistant, the status panel now shows a receipt explaining how much unused credit was refunded, and whether that refund is still being finalized. This helps Freebuff users who pay with compute credits understand that they only lose the amount actually spent on the session, not the entire hour's price. The receipt is visible in the chat header area whenever a previous session has ended, and it disappears as soon as a new active session begins.",
