        "title": "Gemini 4 Argon base3 root adopts lean compaction policy",
        "summary": "The Gemini 4 Argon root agent in `agents/` now sets its compaction option to `GEMINI_4_ARGON_COMPACTION_POLICY`, which aliases `LEAN_COMPACTION_POLICY` defined in `common/src/constants/compaction-policy.ts`. This keeps every request under 110k prompt tokens, bounding the cost of Google flex tier cache misses that bill the entire prompt fresh. The mechanism is a direct alias: the new constant equals `LEAN_COMPACTION_POLICY`, sharing its 40k idle floor and 1-hour cache expiry with Claude Haiku 5.5's 100k row. This is the only change in this commit.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "In `agents/base3-free-gemini-4-argon.ts`, the compaction option is added to the `createBase3CliRoot` call using `GEMINI_4_ARGON_COMPACTION_POLICY`. In `common/src/constants/compaction-policy.ts`, `GEMINI_4_ARGON_COMPACTION_POLICY` is defined as an alias for `LEAN_COMPACTION_POLICY`.",
